#. ja: 我々は祖国「ひんがしの国」より、<br>降神祭を祝しての記念品を持って参った。<br>今後とも、エオルゼア諸国とは良い関係でありたいものだ。
#. de: Sei gegrüßt! Aus dem Fernen Osten bin ich nach Eorzea gekommen, um die Bande zwischen unseren Völkern zu stärken. Zu diesem Zweck habe ich Andenken mitgebracht, die ich zur Himmelswende verteile.
#. fr: C'est avec joie et sans rien attendre en retour que nous vous offrons ce présent oriental pour célébrer la fête de la transition. Puisse notre entente cordiale être éternelle<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/001/FesNyrAmbassador2014_00144:TEXT_FESNYRAMBASSADOR2014_00144_HORSEMISSIONARY_000_000:1"
msgid "In celebration and calculation do we bring a Heavensturn gift, from the Far East to Eorzea. Long may we be of good blood!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……うむ？<br>もしやそなた、余が贈呈した「<sheet Item 6964 0>」をなくしたな？
#. de: Hm? Hatte ich dir nicht schon <noun-de Item 1 6964 1 4 1> geschenkt? Hast du ihn etwa verloren? Hat er dir so wenig bedeutet?
#. fr: <if $gn4>Ma Dame<else>Monseigneur</if>, auriez-vous égaré mon présent, <noun-fr Item 2 6964 1 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>m'lady<else>m'lord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/FesNyrAmbassador2014_00144:TEXT_FESNYRAMBASSADOR2014_00144_HORSEMISSIONARY_000_010:1"
msgid "Has <if $gn4>m'lady<else>m'lord</if> perhaps misplaced the gift <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> was given, that which the giver and the gifted alike call the uma kabuto?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 友好の品をなくすとは、恐れを知らぬ<if $gn4>女<else>男</if>よ……。<br>よい、予備をやろう。<br>今度はなくすでないぞ！
#. de: Nun ja, ich will mal nicht so sein. Hier hast du Ersatz. Aber pass diesmal besser darauf auf, ja?
#. fr: Vous devriez avoir honte d'avoir perdu un objet aussi précieux<nbsp>! Je vous en donne un autre, mais faites plus attention, cette fois...
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/FesNyrAmbassador2014_00144:TEXT_FESNYRAMBASSADOR2014_00144_HORSEMISSIONARY_000_011:1"
msgid "You are a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> fearless and clueless to lose an item of such import! I shall give you another, but misplace it not again."
msgstr ""
